DESCRIPTION:Reading + Discourse\nhttps://luma.com/2czukysp\n\nThe Bay Area
  DSPy Meetup is back\, this time hosted by our friends at Figma\, and wit
 h a book launch. We’re celebrating Mike Taylor’s Context Engineering 
 with DSPy\, then we’ll eat\, drink\, and talk shop until we get kicked 
 out. We’ve got some great lightning talks on DSPy\, building AI systems
 \, evaluations\, and optimizers. Mike Taylor (Head of Evals at Every) wil
 l share a case study from his new book.
